erif;margin:0 0 10px"><span>The firewall=E2=80=99s biggest test yet</span><=
/h2><p style=3D"font:normal 17px/25px georgia,serif;color:#333;margin:0 0 1=
5px"><span>The idea that the far right has to be kept out of power at all c=
osts runs deep in Germany.</span></p><p style=3D"font:normal 17px/25px geor=
gia,serif;color:#333;margin:0 0 15px"><span>In 1933, Hitler=E2=80=99s Nazi =
party was able to take office only after a center-right party agreed to go =
into coalition with it. Less than two months later, democracy had been dism=
antled. That historical catastrophe has underpinned the concept of a firewa=
ll, a voluntary but so far enduring commitment by all parties to shun the A=
fD (though one is currently wavering).</span></p><p style=3D"font:normal 17=
px/25px georgia,serif;color:#333;margin:0 0 15px"><span>It has also been us=
ed as a justification for a range of other measures that mainstream parties=
 have taken to deny the AfD other rights and powers.</span></p><p style=3D"=
font:normal 17px/25px georgia,serif;color:#333;margin:0 0 15px"><span>The s=
tate election in Saxony-Anhalt has challenged this approach like never befo=
re. The firewall and other measures were designed to keep the AfD away from=
 levers of power that opponents say it would use not only to pursue policie=
s like deporting terrorism suspects who are German citizens and share sensi=
tive intelligence with Russia, but also to undermine the country=E2=80=99s =
checks and balances.</span><span style=3D"font-weight:700"> </span><span>Ca=
ll it autocracy-proofing.</span></p><p style=3D"font:normal 17px/25px georg=
ia,serif;color:#333;margin:0 0 15px"><span>But a win at this scale indicate=
s that, at the very least, this strategy isn=E2=80=99t working, and might e=
ven be making the AfD stronger. When a party receives 44 percent of the vot=
e, keeping it out of power looks, to some eyes, less like preserving democr=
acy than thwarting it.</span></p><table border=3D"0" cellpadding=3D"0" cell=
spacing=3D"0" style=3D"width:100%"><tbody><tr><td style=3D"text-align:cente=
